-c13-review-012","quote":"長","source_quote":"十二月庚午，厲王長元年。長，高祖子。"},{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-017","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c04","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","mention_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c04-m001","quote":"淮南厲王","source_quote":"四月丙寅，王勃元年。淮南厲王子，故安陽侯。"},{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-017","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c13","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","mention_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c13-m001","quote":"淮南厲王","source_quote":"四月丙寅，王安元年。淮南厲王子，故阜陵侯。"},{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-017","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c19","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","mention_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c19-m001","quote":"淮南厲王","source_quote":"四月丙寅，王賜元年。淮南厲王子，故陽周侯。"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0041-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"厲王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0099-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"厲王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0131-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"厲王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0135-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"厲王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0165-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"厲王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0197-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p001","quote":"厲王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m001-0206-child","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan"